      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The analgesic activity of acetylsalicylate of lysine (ASL) was evaluated in postoperative pain. Acetylsalicylate of lysine was administered i.v. to 345 patients submitted to obstetrical and gynaecological surgery. Excellent results were obtained in 77.4% of the cases and no severe side-effects were observed."},
